 MT=28   (N,NPG) Cross Section                                     725 1451  389
     From data OF [Di70,Or69,Bu71,Ny71,Cl69,Ne89,Ro74,Ne72,Di73],  725 1451  390
     after subtraction of MF=13,MT=103 data.                       725 1451  391
 MT=32   (N,NAG) Cross Section                                     725 1451  392
